 "text": "Grain Marketing & Storage — Ridgeville Elevator\nCash Bids\nWeather\nGrower Portal\n0\nSkip to Content\nHome\nAbout\nGrain Market/Reports\nServices\nSeed\nFERTILIZER & CHEMICAL\nGrain Marketing & Storage\nTrucking Services\nFeed Solutions\nShow Supplies\nCONTACT US\nOpen Menu\nClose Menu\nHome\nAbout\nGrain Market/Reports\nServices\nSeed\nFERTILIZER & CHEMICAL\nGrain Marketing & Storage\nTrucking Services\nFeed Solutions\nShow Supplies\nCONTACT US\nOpen Menu\nClose Menu\nHome\nAbout\nGrain Market/Reports\nFolder:\nServices\nCONTACT US\nBack\nSeed\nFERTILIZER & CHEMICAL\nGrain Marketing & Storage\nTrucking Services\nFeed Solutions\nShow Supplies\nGrain Marketing & Storage\nSmart Decisions. Stronger Returns.\nWe offer on-site grain storage solutions to support your harvest season and year-round management. From intake to load-out, our facilities are designed for efficient, secure handling of your grain.\nWe’re here to help you market your grain with confidence. With access to real-time prices, market trends, and experienced local support, we work alongside you to build a marketing strategy that fits your operation and risk tolerance.\nWhether you're ready to sell today or planning for harvest, our team will guide you through your options, from cash sales and forward contracts to on-farm storage decisions. Our goal is simple: to help you make informed, timely decisions that support your bottom line.\nWhat we offer\nCurrent local grain bids\nMarket reports and trend insights\nExpert guidance tailored to your farm\nGrain delivery and storage coordination\nRisk management support\nContact Us\nJoin our mailing list\nNewsletter Block\nThis newsletter signup form needs a storage option. Edit the block and enter a storage location via the Storage tab.\nSign up with your email address to receive news and updates.\nEmail Address\nSign Up\nThank you!\nRidgeville Elevator Inc.\nPO BOX 276\nRidgeville Corners, Ohio 43555\nPhone: 419-413-3244\nEmail: kacey.wilkerson@ridgeville-elevator.com\nHours\nMonday: 8:00 AM - 4:30 PM\nTuesday: 8:00 AM - 4:30 PM\nWednesday: 8:00 AM - 4:30 PM\nThursday: 8:00 AM - 4:30 PM\nFriday: 8:00 AM - 4:30 PM\nServing Northwest Ohio Since 1966\nCopyright © 2025- 2026 Ridgeville Elevator Incorporated All Rights Reserved - Legal - Website by Generation 6 Marketing",
